---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="页面不存在 · Hwj · 项目与实践"
  description="你要找的页面不存在或已移动。返回 Hwj 的项目与实践主页，查看代表作与全部公开项目。"
>
  <main class="notfound">
    <p class="notfound-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
    <h1>页面不存在</h1>
    <p>链接可能已失效，或页面被移动了。可以回到主页继续浏览。</p>
    <div class="notfound-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">返回主页</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/skills/">技能广场</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .notfound {
    min-height: 70vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .notfound-code {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .notfound-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
